{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05818","headline":"西塞山下回舟作 · 陶岘","name":"西塞山下回舟作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"匡庐旧业是谁主，吴越新居安此生。\n白发数茎归未得，青山一望计还成。\n鸦翻枫叶夕阳动，鹭立芦花秋水明。\n从此舍舟何所诣，酒旗歌扇正相迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶岘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}